{"id":"hace","lemma":"hace","pos":"prep","rank":87,"glosses":["ago (Note: unlike in English, hace precedes the number.)","in, it has been...since (a past period of time)"],"ipa":"/ˈaθe/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-hace.wav","examples":[{"text":"Sé que hace frío.","en":"I know it's cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/442729"},{"text":"Le vi hace poco.","en":"I saw him recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44765"},{"text":"Hace poco que llovió.","en":"It rained recently.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523792"},{"text":"Hace calor aquí abajo.","en":"It's hot down here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/450621"},{"text":"No hace tanto frío.","en":"It's not that cold.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/103820"}]}